<li><strong>Retail and restaurants</strong> along I-35 and in the downtown square, including strip centers with several tenants.</li>
<li><strong>Office and medical buildings</strong>, where interior build-outs and equipment can make up a large share of the loss.</li>
<li><strong>Warehouse, flex, and light industrial</strong> buildings with metal roofs and large door openings.</li>
